{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1177", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "author_iraiyanbu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘இலக்கியத்தில் மேலாண்மை’ என்னும் உரைநடைப் பகுதியை எழுதிய எழுத்தாளர் மற்றும் முன்னாள் தலைமைச் செயலாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முனைவர் வெ. இறையன்பு இ.ஆ.ப.", "B": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன்", "C": "பக்தவத்சல பாரதி", "D": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி"}, "explanation": "தமிழ் இலக்கியங்களில் பொதிந்துள்ள மேலாண்மைக் கருத்துகளைத் தொகுத்து 'இலக்கியத்தில் மேலாண்மை' என்ற கட்டுரையை எழுதியவர் முனைவர் வெ. இறையன்பு இ.ஆ.ப. ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who is the author of the administrative essay 'Management in Literature' and former Chief Secretary of Tamil Nadu?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Dr. V. Irai Anbu I.A.S.", "B": "Iravatham Mahadevan", "C": "Bhakthavatsala Bharathi", "D": "Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy"}, "explanation": "Dr. V. Irai Anbu I.A.S. authored the acclaimed administrative treatise 'Management in Literature'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Author Irai Anbu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1178", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "management_functions", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நவீன மேலாண்மையியல் நிபுணர்கள் குறிப்பிடும் முதன்மையான மேலாண்மைப் பணிகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கட்டளையிடுதல் மட்டும்", "B": "திட்டமிடுதல், ஒழுங்கமைத்தல், ஆள்தேர்வு, வழிநடத்துதல் மற்றும் கட்டுப்படுத்துதல் (Planning, Organizing, Staffing, Directing, Controlling)", "C": "பணத்தை முதலீடு செய்தல் மட்டும்", "D": "விளம்பரம் செய்தல்"}, "explanation": "நவீன மேலாண்மையில் திட்டமிடல் (Planning), ஒழுங்கமைத்தல் (Organizing), பணியாளர் தேர்வு (Staffing), வழிநடத்துதல் (Directing), கட்டுப்படுத்தல் (Controlling) ஆகியவை முதன்மைப் பணிகளாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What primary operational functions constitute the universal core of modern management science?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Issuing arbitrary orders solely", "B": "Planning, Organizing, Staffing, Directing, and Controlling", "C": "Financial speculation only", "D": "Marketing promotion"}, "explanation": "Management science relies on the classic POSDCORB functions: Planning, Organizing, Staffing, Directing, and Controlling."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Management Functions"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1179", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_human_resources", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘இதனை இதனால் இவன்முடிக்கும் என்றாய்ந்து, அதனை அவன்கண் விடல்’ - இக்குறள் நவீன மேலாண்மையின் எந்தக் கோட்பாட்டிற்கு உகந்த எடுத்துக்காட்டாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நேர மேலாண்மை", "B": "நிதி மேலாண்மை", "C": "மனிதவள மேலாண்மை மற்றும் தகுதியறிந்து பணி ஒப்படைத்தல் (Delegation of Authority)", "D": "சந்தை மேலாண்மை"}, "explanation": "ஒரு குறிப்பிட்ட செயலை இவரால் முடிக்க முடியும் என்று ஆராய்ந்து அவரிடம் பொறுப்பை ஒப்படைப்பது நவீன மேலாண்மையின் 'பணிப் பகிர்வு மற்றும் அதிகாரப் பரவலாக்கல்' (Delegation) கோட்பாடாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "The Kural 'Ithanai ithanaal ivanmudikkum endraainthu...' reflects which paramount modern management principle?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Time optimization", "B": "Financial budget accounting", "C": "Human resource allocation and strategic Delegation of Authority", "D": "Marketing logistics"}, "explanation": "The verse highlights delegation of authority based on thorough competency appraisal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Delegation of Authority"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1180", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "hanuman_crisis_management", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கம்பராமாயணத்தில் இலங்கைக்குத் தூது சென்று சீதையைக் கண்ட அனுமன், இராமனிடம் வந்து கூறிய முதல் சொல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சீதை நலமாக இருக்கிறாள்", "B": "இலங்கையை அழித்தேன்", "C": "வணக்கம்", "D": "‘கண்டனன்’ (கண்டனன் கற்பினுக் கணியை...)"}, "explanation": "இராமனின் இதயத் துடிப்பையும் பதற்றத்தையும் தணிக்க, 'சீதையைக் கண்டேன்' என்று தொடங்குவதற்குப் பதிலாக எடுத்தவுடனேயே ‘கண்டனன்’ என்று வெற்றியின் சுருக்கத்தை முதலில் கூறியது மேலாண்மைத் தொடர்புத் திறனின் உச்சமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Kambar's epic, what exact first word did envoy Hanuman utter to Rama upon returning from Lanka?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sita is safe", "B": "I burned Lanka", "C": "Salutations", "D": "'Kandanen' (Beheld have I the jewel of chastity!)"}, "explanation": "Hanuman instantly allayed Rama's agony by prioritizing the decisive predicate 'Kandanen' (Beheld have I!)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Hanuman Crisis Communication"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1181", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "time_management_thirukkural", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஞாலம் கருதினும் கைகூடும் காலம், கருதி இடத்தாற் செயின்’ - இக்குறள் உணர்த்தும் மேலாண்மைத் தத்துவம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கால மேலாண்மை மற்றும் பொருத்தமான இடத்தேர்வு (Time & Location Management)", "B": "பண விரயம் தடுத்தல்", "C": "படை பெருக்கல்", "D": "மன்னரின் வீரம்"}, "explanation": "தக்க காலத்தையும் அதற்குரிய இடத்தையும் அறிந்து செயல்பட்டால் உலகத்தையே ஆள நினைத்தாலும் அது கைகூடும் என்பது கால மேலாண்மைக் கோட்பாடாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What management principle is encapsulated by 'Gnaalam karuthinum kaikoodum kaalam karuthi idaththaar seyin'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Time Management synchronized with opportune Strategic Location selection", "B": "Cost containment", "C": "Army expansion", "D": "Monarchic valour"}, "explanation": "Acting with perfect timing at the right strategic location enables the conquest of even the globe."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Time Management"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1182", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "swot_analysis_thirukkural", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நவீன வணிக மேலாண்மையில் கூறப்படும் ‘சுவாட் பகுப்பாய்வு’ (SWOT Analysis - பலம், பலவீனம், வாய்ப்பு, அச்சுறுத்தல்) தொல்காப்பியம் மற்றும் திருக்குறளில் எக்குறளில் துலங்குகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொட்டனைத் தூறும் மணற்கேணி...", "B": "‘வினைவலியும் தன்வலியும் மாற்றான் வலியும், துணைவலியும் தூக்கிச் செயல்’", "C": "அகர முதல எழுத்தெல்லாம்...", "D": "கற்க கசடறக் கற்பவை..."}, "explanation": "செயலின் வலிமை (Strength), தன் வலிமை (Internal capacity), எதிரியின் வலிமை (Threat), துணையாளரின் வலிமை (Opportunities) ஆகிய நான்கையும் ஆராய்ந்து செயல்பட வேண்டும் என்ற குறள் SWOT ஆய்விற்கு முன்னோடியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Kural perfectly anticipates the modern corporate management framework of SWOT Analysis?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thottanaith thoorum manarkaeni...", "B": "'Vinaivaliyum thanvaliyum maatraan valiyum thunaivaliyum thookkich seyal'", "C": "Agara muthala ezhuththellaam...", "D": "Karka kasadarak karpavai..."}, "explanation": "Weighing the strength of the deed, one's own power, the adversary's might, and allies' support is classical SWOT analysis."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "SWOT Analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1183", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uraiyanbu_books", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முனைவர் வெ. இறையன்பு அவர்கள் எழுதிய புகழ்பெற்ற மேலாண்மை மற்றும் வழிகாட்டுதல் நூல்களுள் சேராதது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாய்க்கால் மீன்கள்", "B": "பூனா பாரதி", "C": "அஞ்ஞாடி", "D": "படிப்பது சுகமே"}, "explanation": "‘அஞ்ஞாடி’ நாவலை எழுதியவர் பூமணி ஆவார். வாய்க்கால் மீன்கள் (கவிதை), பூனா பாரதி, படிப்பது சுகமே, இலக்கியத்தில் மேலாண்மை ஆகியவற்றை எழுதியவர் வெ. இறையன்பு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following titles was NOT authored by Dr. V. Irai Anbu I.A.S.?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaaikkaal Meengal", "B": "Poonaa Bharathi", "C": "Agnjaadi", "D": "Padippathu Sugamae"}, "explanation": "'Agnjaadi' was written by Poomani; the other three were authored by Dr. V. Irai Anbu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "sourc