{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1188", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "financial_management_thirukkural", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஆகாறு அளவிட்டி தாயினுங் கேடில்லை, போகாறு அகலாக் கடை’ - இக்குறள் உணர்த்தும் மேலாண்மைக் கூறு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பணியாளர் நலம்", "B": "நேரக் கட்டுப்பாடு", "C": "பொருள் உற்பத்தி", "D": "நிதி மேலாண்மை மற்றும் வரவு செலவுத் திட்டமிடல் (Financial & Budgetary Control)"}, "explanation": "வருமானம் வரும் வழி சிறியதாக இருந்தாலும், செலவாகும் வழி விரிவடையாமல் வருமானத்திற்குள் இருந்தால் ஒருபோதும் கேடு வராது என்பது நிதி மேலாண்மை விதியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What fiscal management principle is outlined by 'Aagaaru alavitti thaayinung kaedillai pogaaru agalaak kadai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Staff welfare", "B": "Punctuality", "C": "Factory throughput", "D": "Financial management, budgetary discipline, and expenditure control"}, "explanation": "Even with modest revenue inflows, financial ruin is averted if expenditure outflows never exceed income."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Fiscal Management"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1189", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uraiyanbu_education", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முனைவர் வெ. இறையன்பு அவர்கள் எந்தத் தேர்வில் அகில இந்திய அளவில் தேர்ச்சி பெற்று இந்திய ஆட்சிப் பணியில் (IAS) இணைந்தார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குடிமைப் பணித் தேர்வு (Civil Services Examination)", "B": "நீட் தேர்வு", "C": "டிஎன்பிஎஸ்சி குரூப் 4", "D": "வங்கித் தேர்வு"}, "explanation": "வெ. இறையன்பு யூனியன் பப்ளிக் சர்வீஸ் கமிஷன் (UPSC) நடத்திய குடிமைப் பணித் தேர்வில் வெற்றி பெற்று இ.ஆ.ப. (IAS) அதிகாரியானார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Through which competitive examination did Dr. V. Irai Anbu enter the Indian Administrative Service (IAS)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "UPSC Civil Services Examination", "B": "NEET Examination", "C": "TNPSC Group 4", "D": "Banking Examination"}, "explanation": "Dr. Irai Anbu qualified for the elite Indian Administrative Service through the UPSC Civil Services Examination."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024