{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1199", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ethics_in_management", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மேலாண்மையில் ‘அறநெறி’ (Ethics) எத்தகைய முக்கியத்துவம் வாய்ந்தது என்று ஆசிரியர் விளக்குகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "லாபம் ஈட்டுவதே முதன்மை, அறநெறி தேவையில்லை", "B": "அறநெறி சட்டத்திற்குப் புறம்பானது", "C": "அறநெறியற்ற மேலாண்மை எவ்வளவு பெரிய நிறுவனமாயினும் அதை வீழ்ச்சி அடையச் செய்யும்", "D": "விளம்பரத்திற்கு மட்டுமே அறநெறி பயன்படும்"}, "explanation": "வணிகத்திலோ நிருவாகத்திலோ நெறிமுறைகளும் அறமும் (Ethics) இல்லாத போது அந்நிறுவனம் நீண்ட காலம் நிலைக்க முடியாது; அறமே நிலைத்த வெற்றியைத் தரும் என்பதாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What indispensability does Corporate Ethics hold according to the managerial teachings of the essay?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Profit justifies all means; ethics is unnecessary", "B": "Ethics violates commercial law", "C": "Management devoid of moral ethics inevitably collapses regardless of company scale", "D": "Ethics is purely for PR publicity"}, "explanation": "Unethical management structures are inherently fragile and bound to collapse over time."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Business Ethics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1200", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chola_irrigation_management", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சோழப் பேரரசின் மாபெரும் நீர் மேலாண்மைச் சாதனையாக உலக வரலாற்றில் இன்றளவும் போற்றப்படும் கட்டுமானம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மேட்டூர் அணை", "B": "வைகை அணை", "C": "பவானிசாகர் அணை", "D": "கல்லணை (கரிகால் சோழன் கட்டிய 2000 ஆண்டு காலப் பழமையான அணை)"}, "explanation": "காவிரியின் பெருவெள்ளத்தைத் தடுத்துக் கொள்ளிடத்தில் திருப்பி, பாசனத்திற்குப் பயன்படுத்தக் கரிகாலன் கட்டிய கல்லணையே உலகின் தலைசிறந்த நீர் மேலாண்மைப் பொறியியல் அற்புதமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which 2,000-year-old engineering feat constructed by King Karikala Chola is internationally celebrated as hydraulic management?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mettur Dam", "B": "Vaigai Dam", "C": "Bhavanisagar Dam", "D": "Kallanai (The Grand Anicut across River Cauvery)"}, "explanation": "Kallanai stands as one of the world's oldest functional water diversion and hydraulic management dams."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Kallanai Engineering"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1201", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "listening_skill_thirukkural", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘செல்வத்துள் செல்வம் செவிச்செல்வம் அச்செல்வம், செல்வத்துள் எல்லாம் தலை’ - ஒரு தலைவருக்குரிய எந்த மேலாண்மைத் திறனை இக்குறள் போற்றுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூர்ந்து கவனித்துக் கேட்கும் திறன் (Effective Listening Skills)", "B": "பேசும் திறன் மட்டும்", "C": "எழுதும் திறன்", "D": "பார்வைத் திறன்"}, "explanation": "ஒரு நல்ல தலைவர் பிறர் சொல்வதைப் பொறுமையோடு காதுகொடுத்துக் கேட்கும் 'செவிமடுத்தல்' (Active Listening) திறனைப் பெற்றிருக்க வேண்டும் என்பதை இக்குறள் அறிவுறுத்துகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which crucial executive soft skill is exalted by 'Selvaththul selvam sevichelvam achchelvam selvaththul ellaam thalai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Active, empathic Listening Skills (Sevichchelvam)", "B": "Dominant speaking skill only", "C": "Calligraphy", "D": "Ocular acuity"}, "explanation": "Active listening (Sevichelvam) is the supreme wealth empowering wise executive decisions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbo