{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1213", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "athisaya_malar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "children_laughter_image", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அதிசய மலர்’ கவிதையில் மலரின் சிரிப்போடு கவிஞர் எதனை ஒப்பிட்டுப் பாடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "போரின் அச்சம் நீங்கி விளையாடும் குழந்தைகளின் களங்கமற்ற புன்னகை", "B": "நிலவின் ஒளி", "C": "மின்னலின் கீற்று", "D": "நீரோடையின் சலசலப்பு"}, "explanation": "சாம்பல் படிந்த இடிபாடுகளிடையே பூத்த மலர், எவ்வித அச்சமுமின்றிச் சிரித்து மகிழும் குழந்தைகளின் தூய சிரிப்பைப் போல அமைந்திருப்பதாகப் பாடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To what does the poet analogize the radiant blossom of the miraculous flower in 'Athisaya Malar'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The unblemished innocent laughter of carefree children playing after the ceasefire", "B": "Moonlit beams", "C": "Streaks of lightning", "D": "Babbling brook"}, "explanation": "The blossom is compared to the resilient, innocent laughter of children playing amidst ruins."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "