{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1261", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "author_mahadevan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘சங்ககாலக் கல்வெட்டும் என் நினைவுகளும்’ என்ற தன்வரலாற்று நினைவுக் கட்டுரையை எழுதிய புகழ்பெற்ற இந்தியத் தொல்லியல் மற்றும் கல்வெட்டியல் அறிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன்", "B": "கே.வி. சுப்பிரமணிய ஐயர்", "C": "உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர்", "D": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி"}, "explanation": "இந்திய ஆட்சிப் பணி அதிகாரியாகப் பணியாற்றிப் பின் முழுநேரக் கல்வெட்டு ஆய்வாளராக மாறிய திரு. ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன் இக்கட்டுரையை எழுதியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who is the renowned Indian epigraphist and archaeologist who wrote the autobiographical memoir essay 'Sangkakala Kalvettum En Ninaivugalum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Iravatham Mahadevan", "B": "K.V. Subramaniya Iyer", "C": "U.V. Swaminatha Iyer", "D": "Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy"}, "explanation": "Iravatham Mahadevan, an IAS officer turned full-time epigraphist and scholar, authored this memoir."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 180, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 180", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Supplementary", "Epigraphy"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1262", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "subramaniya_iyer", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்நாட்டில் குகைகளில் காணப்படும் பிராமி எழுத்து வடிவங்கள் பிராகிருத மொழி அல்ல, அவை தமிழ் மொழியே என்று முதன்முதலில் 1924-இல் உலகிற்கு நிலைநாட்டிய முன்னோடித் தொல்லியலாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன்", "B": "கே.வி. சுப்பிரமணிய ஐயர்", "C": "டி.வி. சதாசிவ பண்டாரத்தார்", "D": "எஸ். இராசவேலு"}, "explanation": "1924-இல் அகில இந்தியக் கீழ்த்திசை மாநாட்டில் கே.வி. சுப்பிரமணிய ஐயர் குகைக் கல்வெட்டுகள் தமிழ் மொழியிலேயே அமைந்துள்ளன என்பதை முதன்முதலில் நிறுவினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who was the pioneering epigraphist who first established to the world in 1924 that the Brahmi inscriptions found in caves of Tamil Nadu were in Tamil, not Prakrit?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Iravatham Mahadevan", "B": "K.V. Subramaniya Iyer", "C": "T.V. Sadasiva Pandarathar", "D": "S. Rajavelu"}, "explanation": "At the 1924 All India Oriental Conference, K.V. Subramaniya Iyer first proved that the cave inscriptions were inscribed in the Tamil language."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Supplementary", "KV Subramaniya Iyer"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1263", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mangulam_inscription", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன் மதுரைக்கு அருகில் உள்ள மாங்குளத்தில் கண்டுபிடித்த கல்வெட்டில் குறிப்பிடப்படும் சங்ககாலப் பாண்டிய மன்னன் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தலையாலங்கானத்துச் செருவென்ற நெடுஞ்செழியன்", "B": "ஆரியப்படை கடந்த நெடுஞ்செழியன்", "C": "நெடுஞ்செழியன் (சங்ககாலத் தொடக்க பாண்டிய மன்னன்)", "D": "பூதப்பாண்டியன்"}, "explanation": "மாங்குளம் கல்வெட்டு 'நெடுஞ்செழியன்' என்ற சங்ககாலப் பாண்டிய மன்னனின் பெயரையும் அவனது படைத்தலைவனையும் மிகத் தெளிவாகக் குறிப்பிடுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sangam Pandyan king is mentioned in the Mangulam inscription near Madurai deciphered by Iravatham Mahadevan?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nedunchezhiyan victor of Thalaiyalanganam", "B": "Nedunchezhiyan who crossed the Aryan army", "C": "Nedunchezhiyan (Early Sangam Pandyan ruler)", "D": "Boothapandiyan"}, "explanation": "The Mangulam inscription explicitly records the name of the Sangam Pandyan king Nedunchezhiyan and his military commander."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Supplementary", "Mangulam Inscription"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1264", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pugalur_inscription", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கரூர் அருகே புகழூர் ஆனைமலையில் உள்ள சமணர் குகைக் கல்வெட்டு எத்தனை தலைமுறை சேர மன்னர்களின் மரபுப் பெயர்களைக் குறிப்பிடுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஒரு தலைமுறை", "B": "இரண்டு தலைமுறை", "C": "நான்கு தலைமுறை", "D": "மூன்று தலைமுறை"}, "explanation": "புகழூர்க் கல்வெட்டு கோ ஆதன் செல்லிரும்பொறை, பெருங்கடுங்கோ, இளங்கடுங்கோ ஆகிய மூன்று தலைமுறை சேர மன்னர்களை வரிசையாகக் குறிப்பிடுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many generations of Chera monarchs are chronologically recorded in the Jain cave inscriptions at Pugalur near Karur?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "One generation", "B": "Two generations", "C": "Four generations", "D": "Three generations"}, "explanation": "The Pugalur inscription chronologically mentions three generations of Chera kings: Ko Athan Cheral Irumporai, Perunkadungo, and Ilankadungo."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "