{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1266", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "early_tamil_epigraphy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன் தமிழ்-பிராமி கல்வெட்டுகளை முப்பதாண்டுகளுக்கும் மேலாக ஆராய்ந்து 2003-ஆம் ஆண்டு வெளியிட்ட உலகப்புகழ்பெற்ற ஆய்வு நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The Indus Script: Texts, Concordance and Tables", "B": "Early Tamil Epigraphy: From the Earliest Times to the Sixth Century A.D.", "C": "South Indian Inscriptions", "D": "Epigraphia Indica"}, "explanation": "ஹார்வர்டு பல்கலைக்கழக வெளியீடாகவும் பின்னர் க்ரியா பதிப்பகத்தாலும் 'Early Tamil Epigraphy' என்ற மகத்தான ஆய்வு நூல் 2003-இல் வெளியிடப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which world-renowned research monograph did Iravatham Mahadevan publish in 2003 after researching Tamil-Brahmi inscriptions for over 30 years?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The Indus Script: Texts, Concordance and Tables", "B": "Early Tamil Epigraphy: From the Earliest Times to the Sixth Century A.D.", "C": "South Indian Inscriptions", "D": "Epigraphia Indica"}, "explanation": "His magnum opus 'Early Tamil Epigraphy: From the Earliest Times to the Sixth Century A.D.' was published in 2003 by Harvard University and Cre-A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 183, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 183", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Supplementary", "Early Tamil Epigraphy"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1267", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tamizhi_script", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் பிராமி எழுத்துக்களுக்கு ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன் சூட்டிய தகுந்த வரலாற்றுப் பெயர் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கிரந்த எழுத்து", "B": "வட்டெழுத்து", "C": "தமிழி (Damili)", "D": "கோலெழுத்து"}, "explanation": "சமவாய்ச்சூத்திரம், பன்னவணா சூத்திரம் போன்ற பண்டைய சமண நூல்களின் அடிப்படையில் ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன் இக்குறியீட்டு முறைக்கு 'தமிழி' என்ற பெயரை வழங்கினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What appropriate historical nomenclature did Iravatham Mahadevan designate for Tamil-Brahmi script?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Grantha script", "B": "Vatteluttu", "C": "Tamizhi (Damili)", "D": "Koleluttu"}, "explanation": "Based on ancient Jain texts like Samavayanga Sutra and Pannavana Sutra, he designated the name 'Tamizhi' (Damili) to this script."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 182, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 182", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Supplementary", "Tamizhi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1268", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "indus_script_study", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிந்துவெளி எழுத்துகளுக்கும் திராவிட மொழிக்குமான தொடர்பை நிறுவி ‘The Indus Script: Texts, Concordance and Tables’ என்ற நூலை இந்தியத் தொல்லியல் துறை மூலம் 1977-இல் வெளியிட்டவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அஸ்கோ பர்ப்போலா", "B": "ஃபாதர் ஹெராஸ்", "C": "கமில் சுவலபில்", "D": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன்"}, "explanation": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன் 1977-இல் சிந்துவெளி எழுத்துகள் பற்றிய முழுமையான கணினி வழி ஆய்வுத் தொகுப்பான இந்நூலை வெளியிட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who published 'The Indus Script: Texts, Concordance and Tables' through the Archaeological Survey of India in 1977 linking Indus script to Dravidian roots?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Asko Parpola", "B": "Father Heras", "C": "Kamil Zvelebil", "D": "Iravatham Mahadevan"}, "explanation": "Iravatham Mahadevan published this landmark computer concordance and catalog of the Indus script in 1977."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "