{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1298", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "thonmam_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sangam_myth_usage", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் தொன்மங்கள் எவ்வகையில் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முழுக்க முழுக்கக் கடவுளர்களை மட்டுமே வாழ்த்துவதற்கு", "B": "திணை சார்ந்த புலனெறி வழக்கிலும், மன்னர்களின் வீரத்தையும் கொடையையும் சிறப்பிக்கும் உவமைகளாகவும்", "C": "அறிவியல் உண்மைகளை மறுப்பதற்கு", "D": "நாடோடிக் கதைகளை எழுதுவதற்கு"}, "explanation": "சங்கப் புலவர்கள் தொன்மங்களை உவமைகளாகவும் (எ.கா. இமயவரம்பன், திருவோணத் திருவிழா, இராமன் ஆலமரத்தடியில் அமைதி காத்தது) உத்திகளாகவும் கையாண்டனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How were myths and legends primarily utilized in Sangam anthologies?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Solely for singing praises of deities", "B": "As evocative poetic similes and archetypes celebrating kings' valor, love, and munificence within the Thinai framework", "C": "To repudiate scientific facts", "D": "To record wandering fairy tales"}, "explanation": "Sangam bards employed mythic lore as poignant metaphors and similes honoring chieftains' bravery and generosity within the landscape motif."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 185, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 185", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Grammar", "Sangam Myth"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1299", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "thonmam_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vairamuthu_kavirajan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கவிஞர் வைரமுத்து தனது ‘கவிராஜன் கதை’ என்ற காவியத்தில் எந்தப் புதுக்கவிஞரின் வாழ்க்கையை இதிகாசத் தொன்மங்களோடு ஒப்பிட்டுப் பாடியுள்ளார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாரதிதாசன்", "B": "கண்ணதாசன்", "C": "மகாகவி சுப்பிரமணிய பாரதியார்", "D": "பட்டுக்கோட்டை கல்யாணசுந்தரம்"}, "explanation": "வைரமுத்து பாரதியாரின் புயல் போன்ற வாழ்வையும் போராட்டங்களையும் 'கவிராஜன் கதை' என்னும் காவியத்தில் தொன்மக் குறியீடுகளுடன் படைத்துள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In his biographical verse novel 'Kavirajan Kathai', poet Vairamuthu celebrated whose life using mythic metaphors?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Bharathidasan", "B": "Kannadasan", "C": "Mahakavi Subramaniya Bharathiyar", "D": "Pattukkottai Kalyanasundaram"}, "explanation": "Vairamuthu depicted the tempestuous life and legacy of Mahakavi Bharathi in 'Kavirajan Kathai' using epic metaphors."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edi