{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1315", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "thonmam_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "harischandra_truth", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அரிச்சந்திரன் கதை’ என்ற தொன்மம் தமிழ் மற்றும் இந்தியப் பண்பாட்டில் எதற்கு ஒப்பற்ற அடையாளமாக விளங்குகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "போர்க்கள வீரம்", "B": "செல்வச் செழிப்பு", "C": "எத்தகைய துன்பம் வரினும் தவறாத வாய்மை (சத்தியம்)", "D": "சூழ்ச்சித் திறன்"}, "explanation": "தன் நாட்டையும் மனைவியையும் மகனையும் இழந்து சுடுகாட்டுக் காவல் காத்தபோதும் அரிச்சந்திரன் வாய்மையைக் கைவிடாத தொன்மமாகத் திகழ்கிறான் (காந்தியடிகளுக்கே வழிகாட்டியாய் அமைந்தது)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Tamil and Indian cultural consciousness, what virtue does the myth of 'King Harischandra' epitomize?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Battlefield prowess", "B": "Abundant material wealth", "C": "Uncompromising adherence to truth (Satya) amidst harrowing adversity", "D": "Cunning statecraft"}, "explanation": "Harischandra remains the eternal symbol of unshakeable truth, enduring supreme tribulations without uttering a lie."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 186, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 186", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Grammar", "Harischandra Myth"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1316", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "thonmam_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kailasapathy_critique", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘தொன்மம்’ (Myth) பற்றிய விரிவான ஆய்வுகளைத் தமிழில் மேற்கொண்ட நவீனத் திறனாய்வாளர்களுள் குறிப்பிடத்தக்கவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வ.வே.சு. ஐயர்", "B": "சுப்பிரமணிய பாரதியார்", "C": "திரு. வி. கலியாணசுந்தரனார்", "D": "க. கைலாசபதி (மற்றும் தி.சு. நடராசன்)"}, "explanation": "பேராசிரியர் க. கைலாசபதி (Tamil Heroic Poetry) மற்றும் தி.சு. நடராசன் (கவிதை நயம், திறனாய்வுக் கலை) ஆகியோர் தமிழ் இலக்கியத்தில் தொன்மங்களின் பங்களிப்பைத் திறனாய்வு செய்துள்ளனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who among the following modern Tamil literary critics is notable for conducting comprehensive scholarly research on 'Myth' in Tamil poetics?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "V.V.S. Iyer", "B": "Subramaniya Bharathiyar", "C": "Thiru. Vi. Kalyanasundaranar", "D": "K. Kailasapathy (and T.S. Natarajan)"}, "explanation": "Prof. K. Kailasapathy and Prof. T.S. Natarajan extensively analyzed the structural and thematic role of myths in Tamil poetry."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil N