{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1327", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "mozhippayirchi_iyal7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sol_vagai_maanda", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மாண்ட என் மனைவி’ - இத்தொடரில் ‘மாண்ட’ என்பதன் இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இறந்துபோன", "B": "தொழிற்பெயர்", "C": "மாண்புடைய / சிறந்த (பெயரெச்சம்)", "D": "வினையெச்சம்"}, "explanation": "புறநானூற்றில் பிசிராந்தையார் குறிப்பிடும் 'மாண்ட என் மனைவி' என்பதில் 'மாண்ட' என்பது மாண்புடைய, நற்குணங்கள் நிறைந்த சிறந்த மனைவி என்னும் பெயரெச்சப் பொருளில் வந்துள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Sangam line 'Maanda en manaivi', what is the exact literary meaning of 'Maanda'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Deceased", "B": "Verbal noun", "C": "Noble / Virtuous (Adjectival participle)", "D": "Adverbial participle"}, "explanation": "'Maanda' in Pisiranthaiyar's verse denotes 'noble, virtuous, and exemplary', functioning as an adjectival participle."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": null, "section": null, "