{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1362", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "tnpsc_model_iyal7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_kanganaal_agent", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 2 2016] தேயிலைத் தோட்டப் பாடலில் தமிழகத் தொழிலாளர்களை வஞ்சித்து இலங்கைக்கு அழைத்துச் செல்லும் முகவர்கள் எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்பட்டனர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுபேதார்கள்", "B": "கங்காணிகள்", "C": "ஜமீன்தார்கள்", "D": "குமஸ்தாக்கள்"}, "explanation": "தமிழக ஏழை மக்களை ஆசை வார்த்தைகள் கூறி வஞ்சித்து இலங்கைக் கூலித் தோட்டங்களுக்கு அழைத்துச் சென்ற முகவர்கள் 'கங்காணிகள்' எனப்பட்டனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 2 2016] In 'Theyilai Thottap Paattu', what were the deceptive recruitment brokers taking laborers to Ceylon called?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Subedars", "B": "Kanganis", "C": "Zamindars", "D": "Gumasthas"}, "explanation": "The labor recruiters who exploited workers under the indenture system were known as 'Kanganis'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 174, "chapter": null, "section": null, "ref