{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1371", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "tnpsc_model_iyal7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_kopperunchozhan_vadakkiruthal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 4 2013] தன் மக்களுடன் ஏற்பட்ட மனக்கசப்பால் அறநெறிப்படி வடக்கிருந்து உயிர் நீத்த சங்ககாலச் சோழ மன்னன் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கரிகாலன்", "B": "கிள்ளிவளவன்", "C": "கோப்பெருஞ்சோழன்", "D": "மனுநீதிச் சோழன்"}, "explanation": "கோப்பெருஞ்சோழன் தன் மகன்களோடு போர் புரிய நேர்ந்த சூழலைத் தவிர்த்து, உலக அறநெறிப்படி வடக்கிருந்து உயிர் துறந்தான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Group 4 2013] Which Sangam Chola king chose to fast unto death (Vadakkiruthal) to avert warfare against his own rebellious sons?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Karikalan", "B": "Killivalavan", "C": "Kopperunchozhan", "D": "Manuneethi Chozhan"}, "explanation": "Kopperunchozhan embraced Vadakkiruthal to uphold supreme moral righteousness rather than waging war against his sons."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 178, "chapter": nul